# EDGE_MODE=direct (default): clients connect straight to this VPS.
# Imported into the global `servers` options of ../Caddyfile.
#
# No trusted_proxies: Caddy ignores every client-supplied X-Forwarded-* header
# and {client_ip} is always the TCP peer. HTTP/3 needs UDP 443 (published by
# compose.yaml, allowed by bootstrap-ubuntu.sh).
protocols h1 h2 h3
